      "description": "Single clean Dashboard runway with remaining amount, labeled progress, and open income/spent stats.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-runway\"><h1>Dashboard</h1><p>Your budget remaining</p><strong>₱18,400</strong><p>From ₱30,000 through Sep 30</p><div class=\"ds-endpoints\"><span>₱11,600 spent</span><span>₱30,000 limit</span></div><div class=\"ds-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Monthly budget used\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"39\"><div></div></div><div class=\"ds-endpoints\"><span>39% used</span><span>61% safe to spend</span></div><div class=\"ds-stats\"><p>Income<strong>₱42,000</strong></p><p>Spent<strong>₱11,600</strong></p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-runway{font-family:NunitoRegular,Nunito,sans-serif;background:hsl(var(--brand-header));color:hsl(var(--brand-header-foreground));border-radius:16px;padding:24px;box-shadow:none}.ds-runway h1{font-family:NunitoBold,Nunito,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:36px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 48px}.ds-runway>strong{display:block;font-family:NunitoBold,Nunito,sans-serif;font-size:60px;line-height:60px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:4px 0}.ds-runway>p{font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0}.ds-endpoints{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-progress{height:8px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(255 255 255 / .2);margin-top:8px}.ds-progress>div{height:100%;width:100%;transform:translateX(-61%);border-radius:9999px;background:#fff;transition:transform 500ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-progress>div{transition:none}}.ds-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1px 1fr;border-top:1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / .28);margin-top:24px;padding-top:16px}.ds-stats:before{content:\"\";grid-column:2;background:rgb(255 255 255 / .28)}.ds-stats p{display:flex;grid-row:1;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin:0;padding-right:16px}.ds-stats p+ p{grid-column:3;padding:0 0 0 16px}.ds-stats strong{font-family:NunitoBold,Nunito,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget Progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "progress-track",
      "description": "Eight-pixel runway progress with labeled endpoints, clamped value, exponential ease-out, and reduced-motion fallback.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Monthly budget used\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"40\"><div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-progress{height:8px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(255 255 255 / .2)}.ds-progress>div{height:100%;width:100%;transform:translateX(-60%);border-radius:9999px;background:#fff;transition:transform 500ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-progress>div{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation Colors",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Schematic color demonstration only. NativeTabs owns actual platform geometry, icons, and interaction.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Destinations\"><span aria-current=\"page\">Dashboard</span><span>Explore</span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));padding:16px;gap:24px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-nav [aria-current]{color:hsl(var(--primary));background:hsl(var(--secondary))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Spending Pie",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Compact solid 156px SVG pie; illustrative category amounts paired with explicit labels. Native chart computes arbitrary slices.",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-pie\"><svg width=\"156\" height=\"156\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Food 50 percent, Travel 50 percent\"><path d=\"M50 50 L50 1 A49 49 0 0 1 50 99 Z\" fill=\"hsl(var(--expense))\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\".7\"/><path d=\"M50 50 L50 99 A49 49 0 0 1 50 1 Z\" fill=\"hsl(var(--chart-1))\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\".7\"/></svg><figcaption><p>Food <strong>₱3,000</strong></p><p>Travel <strong>₱3,000</strong></p></figcaption></figure>",
      "css": ".ds-pie{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:20px;color:hsl(var(--card-foreground));font-family:NunitoRegular,Nunito,sans-serif}.ds-pie figcaption{width:100%}.ds-pie p{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-pie strong{font-family:NunitoBold,Nunito,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Month Chevron",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "month-control",
      "description": "20px rounded SVG chevron in a labeled minimum-48px secondary pill control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chevron\" aria-label=\"Previous month\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 5L8 12L15 19\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-chevron{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;min-width:48px;padding:8px 16px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--secondary));color:hsl(var(--secondary-foreground));box-shadow:0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / .05);cursor:pointer}.ds-chevron:hover,.ds-chevron:active{background:hsl(var(--secondary) / .8)}.ds-chevron:focus-visible{outline:3px solid hsl(var(--ring) / .5);outline-offset:2px}"
    }
